{"id":"interlaken","name":"因特拉肯","en":"Interlaken","country":"Switzerland","lat":46.6872,"lng":7.8649,"dek":"两湖之间，雪峰脚下的交通与眺望枢纽","history":"因特拉肯一带曾出土新石器时代燧石、青铜时代早期的剑和古罗马钱币，但没有证据表明中世纪以前这里已有稳定聚落。约1130年，因特拉肯修道院在阿勒河北侧的马滕地界建立，受神圣罗马帝国保护。此后两百年间，修道院成为该地区最大的土地所有者，奠定了这一带聚落发展的基础。\n\n14世纪时，今天因特拉肯市区所在位置还叫Aarmühle村，隶属马滕。宗教改革后，修道院于1528年世俗化，土地被伯尔尼市政府吞并，部分建筑转为政府驻地。1746年至1750年，修道院西翼被拆除，总督塞缪尔·蒂利尔在原地建造新城堡，后来成为因特拉肯的行政中心。\n\n1800年前后，瑞士画家弗朗茨·尼克劳斯·柯尼希等人的风景画与瑞士文化节的成功举办，让这一地区开始受到游客注意。歌德、拜伦、门德尔松先后到访。1835年和1839年，图恩湖与布里恩茨湖相继开通蒸汽船航线。1872年起，Bödeli铁路、布吕尼格铁路、伯尔尼高地铁路、图恩湖铁路陆续通车，1912年少女峰铁路建成。随着交通网逐步完善，因特拉肯从一个小聚落发展为伯尔尼高地的旅游门户。","culture":"因特拉肯的城市性格很大程度是由地理决定的。它夹在图恩湖与布里恩茨湖之间，又面向南侧少女峰、艾格峰与僧侣峰，因此很早就以“眺望”和“中转”为功能。Höheweg大道连接东西两座火车站，沿途可见维多利亚少女峰大饭店和Höhematte草坪上的雪山视野，是游客密度最高的地带。靠近西站的下塞恩则保留更多本地生活感，有不少面包房和商店。\n\n这座小城与周边马滕、下塞恩、伯尼根等市镇共同构成旅游区域，总人口约一万六千人，淡旺季差异明显。因地势平坦、交通便利，因特拉肯也是前往劳特布伦嫩、格林德瓦和小夏戴克等山地目的地的起点。","pull":"城市名字的意思只是“在湖泊之间”","sights":[{"name":"Höheweg大道","orig":"Höheweg","intro":"因特拉肯的主街，连接西站与东站，沿途集中了纪念品商店、酒店和餐厅。街上有日本花园和开业超过一个半世纪的维多利亚少女峰大饭店。从Höhematte草坪可以望见南侧终年积雪的少女峰。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Interlaken_-_panoramio_-_Patrick_Nouhailler%27s%E2%80%A6_%2832%29.jpg/960px-Interlaken_-_panoramio_-_Patrick_Nouhailler%27s%E2%80%A6_%2832%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":null},{"name":"少女峰","orig":"Jungfrau","intro":"伯尔尼阿尔卑斯山脉标志性山峰之一，海拔4158米。因特拉肯市区就能看到其雪线之上的山体。游客可经小夏戴克换乘少女峰铁路，前往欧洲海拔最高的火车站之一少女峰山坳。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Jungfrau.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":651},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3%E5%B3%B0"},{"name":"下塞恩","orig":"Unterseen","intro":"靠近因特拉肯西站的老城小聚落，比主街安静得多。1279年至1280年间开始发展，至今保留着更接近本地生活的尺度，有不少面包房和商店。从西站附近过桥即可到达。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Unterseen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":651},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8B%E5%A1%9E%E6%81%A9"},{"name":"布里恩茨湖","orig":"Brienzersee","intro":"位于因特拉肯东侧，湖水来自阿勒河。湖畔小镇布里恩茨以木雕传统出名，距离因特拉肯约二十分钟车程。湖上有固定游船航线，码头靠近火车站。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Aerial_image_of_Lake_Brienz_%28view_from_the_southwest%29.jpg/960px-Aerial_image_of_Lake_Brienz_%28view_from_the_southwest%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":653},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E9%87%8C%E6%81%A9%E8%8C%A8%E6%B9%96"},{"name":"图恩湖","orig":"Thunersee","intro":"位于因特拉肯西侧，湖水同样由阿勒河连通。1835年这里开通蒸汽船航线，是这一带最早的水上交通线之一。黄昏时从湖边可看到光线沿着山体向下滑落。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Aerial_image_of_Lake_Thun_%28view_from_the_east%29.jpg/960px-Aerial_image_of_Lake_Thun_%28view_from_the_east%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":646},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BE%E6%81%A9%E6%B9%96"}],"foods":[{"name":"奶酪火锅","orig":"Fondue","intro":"将奶酪在锅中小火加热融化，用长叉蘸面包食用的瑞士传统热菜。因特拉肯一些面向游客的餐厅会提供，适合两三人分食，通常配白葡萄酒或茶。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Fondue_dish.jpg/960px-Fondue_dish.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%9D%E5%A3%AB%E7%81%AB%E9%8D%8B"},{"name":"奶酪土豆","orig":"Raclette","intro":"把表面融化的奶酪刮下，浇在带皮小土豆和腌菜上。因特拉肯的旅游餐厅常有供应，尤其在冬季更常见。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Raclette_20040817_140816.jpg/960px-Raclette_20040817_140816.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":641},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raclette"},{"name":"瑞士巧克力","orig":"Schweizer Schokolade","intro":"以牛奶巧克力最为常见，口感偏滑顺。因特拉肯西站和东站附近超市都能买到当地超市品牌的排块巧克力，价格比景区礼品店低。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Vegan_Flourless_Swiss_Chocolate_Molten_Lava_Cake_%284867538601%29.jpg/960px-Vegan_Flourless_Swiss_Chocolate_Molten_Lava_Cake_%284867538601%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%91%9E%E5%A3%AB%E5%B7%A7%E5%85%8B%E5%8A%9B"},{"name":"麦片酸奶","orig":"Birchermüesli","intro":"由燕麦片、坚果、水果和酸奶或牛奶混合而成的冷食，适合早餐。瑞士的酒店早餐常会提供，超市也可买到即食装。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Dorset_Cereals_muesli.jpg/960px-Dorset_Cereals_muesli.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":742},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muesli"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/5629_-_Schynige_Platte_-_View_of_Interlaken_and_Thunersee.JPG/1280px-5629_-_Schynige_Platte_-_View_of_Interlaken_and_Thunersee.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":862},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/5639_-_Schynige_Platte_-_View_of_Interlaken_and_Thunersee.JPG/1280px-5639_-_Schynige_Platte_-_View_of_Interlaken_and_Thunersee.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[7.8267786,46.6659153],[7.8282558,46.664589],[7.840333,46.669958],[7.8475194,46.6755391],[7.8562638,46.679372],[7.8569843,46.6812802],[7.8622653,46.6843141],[7.8683065,46.6845814],[7.8703324,46.682266],[7.8745056,46.6833433],[7.8887741,46.6834165],[7.8881941,46.6918539],[7.8853619,46.6923503],[7.8847273,46.6932713],[7.8857512,46.6939328],[7.8713463,46.692543],[7.8712942,46.6935405],[7.8682433,46.6954812],[7.8607916,46.7040906],[7.8598526,46.703856],[7.8546266,46.6995577],[7.8569511,46.6960887],[7.85788,46.6976169],[7.8604147,46.6961004],[7.8609378,46.6921593],[7.8623308,46.6921578],[7.8619641,46.6899766],[7.8528316,46.6883158],[7.850765,46.6839174],[7.8466599,46.6815164],[7.8453033,46.6794678],[7.848242,46.6789676],[7.8459266,46.6760571],[7.8267786,46.6659153]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"因特拉肯","en":"Interlaken","voyage":"Interlaken"}}}